tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=134,TalkTime=156}] {"text":"<Az> A long, long time ago. A very long time ago."}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=134,TalkTime=163}] {"text":"<Az> The man made an ultimate weapon."}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=134,TalkTime=170}] {"text":"<Az> Using it required the life force of many Pokémon..."}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=134,TalkTime=177}] {"text":"<Az> The Pokémon granted eternal life learned this."}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=134,TalkTime=184}] {"text":"<Az> The resurrected eternal Pokémon left the man's side."}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=134,TalkTime=191}] {"text":"<Az> The man was surprised and sad. He had revived it so they could be together..."}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=134,TalkTime=198}] {"text":"<Az> Day after day passed, but they were never to meet."}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=134,TalkTime=205}] {"text":"<Az> Eventually, he became a mere shell of a man."}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=134,TalkTime=212}] {"text":"<Az> A man condemned to wander forever by the light of the weapon..."}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=134,TalkTime=219}] {"text":"<Az> And a Pokémon that also wanders eternally..."}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=134,TalkTime=226}] {"text":"<Az> Where is it now? What do I have to do to meet it?"}

