tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=146,TalkTime=8}] {"text":"<Serena> I've been thinking ever since all that trouble in Geosenge."}]
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=146,TalkTime=16}] {"text":"<Serena> Lysandre chose only Team Flare. You and I chose everyone but Team Flare."}]
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=146,TalkTime=24}] {"text":"<Serena> But since our positions forced our hands, you can't really say any of us were right."}]
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=146,TalkTime=33}] {"text":"<Serena> That's why I feel that..."}]
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=146,TalkTime=39}] {"text":"<Serena> If both sides have something to say, maybe it's best to meet halfway..."}]
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=146,TalkTime=47}] {"text":"<Serena> So, I made a decision..."}]
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=146,TalkTime=53}] {"text":"<Serena> From now on, I don't want to battle just to win but to see how you and your Pokémon think and feel!"}]
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=146,TalkTime=63}] {"text":"<Serena> That's the kind of Pokémon Battle I'm going to have with you right now!"}]

