#----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#Malva post-battle
#/tedit add LOSS /scoreboard players set @pl DialogueTrigger 196
#/tedit add LOSS /scoreboard players set @pl TalkTime 0

#Resets if player hasn't heard Butler's prior player-win dialogue
execute as @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=196}] run scoreboard players set @s DialogueTrigger 196

tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=196,TalkTime=5}] {"text":"<Malva> Enough for now. I brought you here for a reason."}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=196,TalkTime=13}] {"text":"<Malva> The first issue is the identity of the Trainer called Essentia."}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=196,TalkTime=21}] {"text":"<Malva> In truth, she is simply a young girl called Emma,"}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=196,TalkTime=30}] {"text":"<Malva> wearing a piece of special technology dubbed the Expansion Suit."}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=196,TalkTime=38}] {"text":"<Malva> The Expansion Suit was created by Dr. Xerosic."}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=196,TalkTime=46}] {"text":"<Malva> I can see that name means something to you. You remember him, I take it."}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=196,TalkTime=55}] {"text":"<Malva> ...One of Team Flare's scientists."}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=196,TalkTime=62}] {"text":"<Malva> This brings me to my request, young trainer. Make sure Xerosic disappears."}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=196,TalkTime=70}] {"text":"<Malva> I don't care how. If you need a reason, call it honor among thieves..."}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=196,TalkTime=78}] {"text":"<Malva> Even we in Team Flare had our sense of pride."}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=196,TalkTime=86}] {"text":"<Malva> You may have disagreed with us, but we were doing what we thought right."}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=196,TalkTime=94}] {"text":"<Malva> I won't let him sully our honor now."}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=196,TalkTime=101}] {"text":"<Malva> The hero of Kalos would hardly wish for that girl Emma to keep staining her hands with these crimes as Essentia."}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=196,TalkTime=113}] {"text":"<Malva> If you want to help the girl, you need to put a stop to Xerosic. And that I can help you with!"}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=196,TalkTime=123}] {"text":"<Malva> If we leave now, we should find him at Lysandre Café."}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=196,TalkTime=130}] {"text":"<Malva> Don't dawdle. Be ready to face death if you go."}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=196,TalkTime=140}] {"text":"<Malva> Prepare well if you want a shot at surviving."}

