tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=198,TalkTime=35}] {"text":"<Malva> And voilà! Now you have access to the secret floor of Lysandre Labs."}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=198,TalkTime=44}] {"text":"<Malva> You should find Xerosic and his Essentia there. The rest I leave to you."}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=198,TalkTime=52}] {"text":"<Malva> The secret floor has the same layout as this one. You defeated Team Flare once, right?"}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=198,TalkTime=62}] {"text":"<Malva> Then this should be a piece of cake. Oh. And one last thing..."}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=198,TalkTime=71}] {"text":"<Malva> Tell that partner of yours... Tell that infuriating man..."}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=198,TalkTime=79}] {"text":"<Malva> Yes, tell him I fulfilled my end of the bargain."}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=198,TalkTime=87}] {"text":"<Malva> And he should keep in mind what will happen to him if he doesn't do the same. Good day."}

